{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7 by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The letter <b>M</b> in the figure below is first reflected over the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and then reflected over the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. What is the resulting image?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38b67d113d5fbf1b6d6eae0d87161b539dbd849.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] // pog diagram usepackage(&quot;newtxtext&quot;); size(3cm); draw((-1,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1)); label(&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(0.25,0.6)); draw((-0.8,-0.8)--(0.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1)); label(&quot;$p$&quot;, (-1,0),NE); label(&quot;$q$&quot;, (-0.75,-0.75), N*1.5); [/asy]\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b58c8f6aafe00e0ad5454583fda04c3567f944.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] // pog diagram usepackage(&quot;newtxtext&quot;); size(12.5cm); draw((-1,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1)); label(rotate(90)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(0.6,-0.25)); draw((-0.8,-0.8)--(0.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1));  label(&quot;$\\textbf{(A)}$&quot;,(-1,1),W); draw((2,0)--(4,0)); draw((3,-1)--(3,1)); label(rotate(270)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(2.8,0.7)); draw((2.2,-0.8)--(3.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1));  label(&quot;$\\textbf{(B)}$&quot;,(2,1),W); draw((5,0)--(7,0)); draw((6,-1)--(6,1)); label(rotate(90)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(5.4,0.2)); draw((5.2,-0.8)--(6.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1));  label(&quot;$\\textbf{(C)}$&quot;,(5,1),W); draw((-1,-2.5)--(1,-2.5)); draw((0,-3.5)--(0,-1.5)); label(rotate(180)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(-0.25,-3.1)); draw((-0.8,-3.3)--(0.8,-1.7),linewidth(1.1));  label(&quot;$\\textbf{(D)}$&quot;,(-1,-1.5),W); draw((2,-2.5)--(4,-2.5)); draw((3,-3.5)--(3,-1.5)); label(rotate(270)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(3.6,-2.75)); draw((2.2,-3.3)--(3.8,-1.7),linewidth(1.1));  label(&quot;$\\textbf{(E)}$&quot;,(2,-1.5),W); [/asy]\" width=\"592\" height=\"325\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <b>M</b> is first reflected over the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34b2864f06b4e50859a0bea1a812d50a2154547b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> we obtain the following diagram:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40c26208a133e8893a6c0dffc050e5c046953f21.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] /* Made by MRENTHUSIASM */ usepackage(&quot;newtxtext&quot;); size(3cm); draw((-1,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1)); label(rotate(270)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(0.6,0.25)); draw((-0.8,-0.8)--(0.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1));  [/asy]\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\" />\nWhen <b>M</b> is then reflected over the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c699725218958e044a4f271042b0b40b9ed713f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" /> we obtain the following diagram:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5fb7ca1ab4567bbf6f1786661b033a767d9756c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] /* Made by MRENTHUSIASM */ usepackage(&quot;newtxtext&quot;); size(3cm); draw((-1,0)--(1,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1)); label(rotate(270)*&quot;$\\textbf{\\textsf{M}}$&quot;,(0.6,-0.25)); draw((-0.8,-0.8)--(0.8,0.8),linewidth(1.1));  [/asy]\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\" />\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/9637ded1c3fcafb638e9de07271242a795f4043c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"42\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=350\">https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=350</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=l-XMI73aofM6q4ye&amp;t=320\">https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=l-XMI73aofM6q4ye&amp;t=320</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution 2 (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lItyKxX_qB8\">https://youtu.be/lItyKxX_qB8</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=259\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=259</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/c-D-bj2htGE\">https://youtu.be/c-D-bj2htGE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Q0R6dnIO95Y?t=182\">https://youtu.be/Q0R6dnIO95Y?t=182</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_6\">Video Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kkJVsOKcuk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kkJVsOKcuk</a>\n</p><p>~harungurcan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_7_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution 7 by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 7 by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\